      "dc:description": {
        "de": [
          "Das vollständige Programm des Telethon 2025 finden Sie über diesen Link: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nj77dT4guDpbLlsMGpie190TyLCIJq7H?dmr=1&ec=wgc-drive-globalnav-goto\n\nDer Telethon findet vom 29. November bis zum 17. Januar 2025 statt."
        ],
        "en": [
          "To find out more about the Telethon 2025 program, click here: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nj77dT4guDpbLlsMGpie190TyLCIJq7H?dmr=1&ec=wgc-drive-globalnav-goto\n\nThe Telethon will be held from November 29 to January 17, 2025."
        ],
        "it": [
          "Per il programma completo di Telethon 2025, clicca qui: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nj77dT4guDpbLlsMGpie190TyLCIJq7H?dmr=1&ec=wgc-drive-globalnav-goto\n\nTelethon si terrà dal 29 novembre al 17 gennaio 2025."
        ],
        "fr": [
          "Retrouvez le programme complet du Téléthon 2025 via ce lien : https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nj77dT4guDpbLlsMGpie190TyLCIJq7H?dmr=1&ec=wgc-drive-globalnav-goto\n\nLe Téléthon se tiendra du 29 novembre au 17 janvier 2025."
        ],
        "es": [
          "Para consultar el programa completo del Telemaratón 2025, pulse aquí: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nj77dT4guDpbLlsMGpie190TyLCIJq7H?dmr=1&ec=wgc-drive-globalnav-goto\n\nEl Telemaratón se celebrará del 29 de noviembre al 17 de enero de 2025."
        ],
        "nl": [
          "Klik hier voor het volledige programma van de 2025 Telethon: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nj77dT4guDpbLlsMGpie190TyLCIJq7H?dmr=1&ec=wgc-drive-globalnav-goto\n\nDe Telethon wordt gehouden van 29 november tot 17 januari 2025."
